1
00:01:03,800 --> 00:01:07,080
[Fragments of Truth]

2
00:01:07,080 --> 00:01:08,600
[Episode 12]

3
00:01:13,680 --> 00:01:13,920
Okay.

4
00:01:16,590 --> 00:01:18,120
The expert's test results are in.

5
00:01:18,560 --> 00:01:20,710
Chen Yun does have bipolar disorder,

6
00:01:21,120 --> 00:01:22,350
but she has no delusional disorder.

7
00:01:23,150 --> 00:01:25,150
She tried to feign insanity and fool us.

8
00:01:25,400 --> 00:01:26,480
We have new evidence now.

9
00:01:26,480 --> 00:01:27,310
She won't be able to deny it.

10
00:01:27,310 --> 00:01:28,120
Mm-hmm.

11
00:01:30,560 --> 00:01:31,790
We need to question Zhou Yong again.

12
00:01:32,070 --> 00:01:33,680
We don't know how involved he was.

13
00:01:33,920 --> 00:01:34,710
Yes.

14
00:01:51,280 --> 00:01:52,000
[Interrogation Room 3]

15
00:01:52,000 --> 00:01:53,950
We found the fridge that held the body.

16
00:01:54,400 --> 00:01:56,870
You dumped it at the demolition site,

17
00:01:57,200 --> 00:01:59,000
but Mrs. Song took it home.

18
00:01:59,950 --> 00:02:03,120
We found your husband's blood inside.

19
00:02:05,590 --> 00:02:07,120
I don't know what you're talking about.

20
00:02:09,870 --> 00:02:11,520
Dragging this out is pointless.

21
00:02:11,910 --> 00:02:13,560
Once we find your husband's remains,

22
00:02:13,590 --> 00:02:15,360
we'll have a complete chain of evidence.

23
00:02:17,710 --> 00:02:20,310
You can't have dumped them very far.

24
00:02:20,750 --> 00:02:23,000
The gate cameras never saw you leave,

25
00:02:23,560 --> 00:02:24,000
so I think

26
00:02:24,000 --> 00:02:26,470
you dumped them within the complex.

27
00:02:27,150 --> 00:02:28,800
There are many stray dogs nearby.

28
00:02:29,280 --> 00:02:31,590
Burying the remains was too risky.

29
00:02:32,710 --> 00:02:36,190
That leaves places like sewer manholes.

30
00:03:49,470 --> 00:03:50,280
We're trying to give you a chance

31
00:03:50,280 --> 00:03:52,750
to receive a lighter sentence.

32
00:03:53,080 --> 00:03:54,470
Once the evidence chain is complete,

33
00:03:54,470 --> 00:03:57,150
we can convict you
without your statement.

34
00:03:57,710 --> 00:03:57,910
So

35
00:03:57,910 --> 00:04:00,800
you'd better tell us what happened now.

36
00:04:02,710 --> 00:04:04,520
Of course, you don't have to talk.

37
00:04:04,800 --> 00:04:06,000
Zhou Yong is right next door.

38
00:04:07,710 --> 00:04:10,000
I doubt he knows any less than you.

39
00:04:10,360 --> 00:04:12,520
But only one of you can get leniency.

40
00:04:13,150 --> 00:04:16,920
It depends on who speaks first.

41
00:04:23,000 --> 00:04:25,070
Zhou Yong had nothing to do with this.

42
00:04:27,360 --> 00:04:28,680
I killed him.

43
00:04:29,480 --> 00:04:31,120
Wu Jia deserved to die.

44
00:04:31,560 --> 00:04:33,190
He killed his own child.

45
00:04:33,190 --> 00:04:34,360
And he tried to drive me to suicide.

46
00:04:34,360 --> 00:04:36,270
He got what he deserved.

47
00:04:42,160 --> 00:04:45,120
[Interview Room 1]

48
00:04:55,360 --> 00:04:56,270
Officer.

49
00:04:56,870 --> 00:04:58,510
When can I go back?

50
00:05:02,720 --> 00:05:04,160
Some of Wu Jia's remains

51
00:05:04,160 --> 00:05:05,600
were found in the sewer.

52
00:05:05,600 --> 00:05:06,600
I didn't kill anyone.

53
00:05:06,600 --> 00:05:07,950
There's no need to deny it so quickly.

54
00:05:08,240 --> 00:05:09,600
Chen Yun has confessed.

55
00:05:10,040 --> 00:05:11,630
She said she killed Wu Jia.

56
00:05:12,040 --> 00:05:14,190
She said she did it all alone.

57
00:05:14,190 --> 00:05:18,040
You didn't help dismember or dump him.

58
00:05:19,040 --> 00:05:19,830
No.

59
00:05:20,600 --> 00:05:21,390
No.

60
00:05:21,630 --> 00:05:22,800
Ms. Yun would never kill anyone.

61
00:05:22,800 --> 00:05:24,190
Are you sure you haven't made a mistake?

62
00:05:26,190 --> 00:05:27,390
Captain Ren, a word.

63
00:05:33,310 --> 00:05:35,190
Chen Yun confessed.

64
00:05:36,190 --> 00:05:38,430
Yes.
She's taking all the blame.

65
00:05:39,040 --> 00:05:41,190
I think she's covering for Zhou Yong.

66
00:05:42,160 --> 00:05:43,630
Has Zhou Yong confessed?

67
00:05:44,430 --> 00:05:45,240
No.

68
00:05:46,720 --> 00:05:48,920
A colleague from our tech unit said

69
00:05:48,920 --> 00:05:51,000
they recovered data from his computer.

70
00:05:51,240 --> 00:05:53,600
I downloaded this from it.
Look.

71
00:05:56,190 --> 00:05:57,390
He's not as devoted as he claims.

72
00:06:10,750 --> 00:06:11,560
Stop pretending.

73
00:06:12,160 --> 00:06:13,430
When Wu Jia was killed,

74
00:06:14,160 --> 00:06:15,360
you not only knew about it,

75
00:06:15,630 --> 00:06:16,950
you took part in the entire process.

76
00:06:16,950 --> 00:06:18,190
Don't try to frame me.

77
00:06:18,510 --> 00:06:20,430
I knew nothing about any of it.

78
00:06:21,190 --> 00:06:22,720
Don't believe me?
Ask Chen Yun.

79
00:06:22,800 --> 00:06:24,120
She can clear my name.

80
00:06:24,430 --> 00:06:26,310
You planned everything.

81
00:06:26,430 --> 00:06:28,000
You exploited her feelings for you

82
00:06:28,040 --> 00:06:29,430
to make her take the blame.

83
00:06:31,040 --> 00:06:32,040
And then

84
00:06:32,390 --> 00:06:34,040
you asked her to clear your name.

85
00:06:34,190 --> 00:06:35,040
How shameless.

86
00:06:36,160 --> 00:06:36,950
I...

87
00:06:38,600 --> 00:06:39,830
You don't need to provoke me.

88
00:06:40,040 --> 00:06:42,920
No matter how close Chen Yun and I are,

89
00:06:43,160 --> 00:06:45,430
no one can take a murder rap for her.

90
00:06:45,430 --> 00:06:47,390
Enough.

91
00:06:47,950 --> 00:06:49,600
People like you

92
00:06:49,720 --> 00:06:51,560
are completely self-centered.

93
00:06:51,560 --> 00:06:52,800
Say whatever you want.

94
00:06:53,040 --> 00:06:55,160
I knew nothing about this.

95
00:06:56,040 --> 00:06:58,750
If you say I took part in the murder,

96
00:06:59,040 --> 00:07:00,720
then show me the evidence.

97
00:07:02,720 --> 00:07:03,600
Evidence, right?

98
00:07:04,360 --> 00:07:05,240
Take a close look.

99
00:07:08,040 --> 00:07:08,950
And this photo,

100
00:07:08,950 --> 00:07:11,040
we copied it from your computer.

101
00:07:11,430 --> 00:07:13,040
Although you deleted the file,

102
00:07:13,040 --> 00:07:14,310
we recovered it.

103
00:07:17,720 --> 00:07:19,120
Tell us everything.

104
00:07:19,430 --> 00:07:20,800
This is your last chance.

105
00:07:25,800 --> 00:07:26,630
Don't want to talk?

106
00:07:27,310 --> 00:07:28,120
Fine.

107
00:07:29,120 --> 00:07:31,560
Then I'll tell your story for you.

108
00:07:32,800 --> 00:07:33,920
One day,

109
00:07:34,240 --> 00:07:36,950
you saw your beautiful neighbor

110
00:07:37,510 --> 00:07:39,160
and wanted to make her yours.

111
00:07:39,830 --> 00:07:42,800
But she had a vicious husband

112
00:07:43,310 --> 00:07:44,750
who discovered what you wanted.

113
00:07:45,430 --> 00:07:48,800
Then, to your surprise,
he offered a deal.

114
00:07:49,920 --> 00:07:51,830
He secretly gave her sleeping pills

115
00:07:51,920 --> 00:07:53,630
and let you have what you wanted.

116
00:07:59,750 --> 00:08:02,630
Maybe you couldn't stop after that.

117
00:08:02,830 --> 00:08:05,830
Maybe you really fell for Chen Yun.

118
00:08:06,720 --> 00:08:10,630
Or maybe his threats

119
00:08:10,630 --> 00:08:12,160
left you constantly on edge.

120
00:08:13,000 --> 00:08:15,120
In the end, you killed him

121
00:08:16,000 --> 00:08:18,430
and made Chen Yun take the blame.

122
00:08:22,040 --> 00:08:24,920
Ha ha ha!

123
00:08:25,120 --> 00:08:26,240
I really must

124
00:08:26,240 --> 00:08:28,800
admire your imagination, officers.

125
00:08:28,950 --> 00:08:30,750
What a fascinating story.

126
00:08:31,190 --> 00:08:34,550
Yes, Chen Yun and I had an affair.

127
00:08:35,150 --> 00:08:36,750
But it was consensual.

128
00:08:37,200 --> 00:08:41,030
So what?
Photos with a lover aren't a crime.

129
00:08:42,550 --> 00:08:45,440
As for what happened with Wu Jia,

130
00:08:46,550 --> 00:08:48,390
unless you can show me evidence,

131
00:08:49,630 --> 00:08:51,600
I'll sue you for defamation.

132
00:08:52,600 --> 00:08:53,960
I knew you'd say that.

133
00:08:55,200 --> 00:08:56,630
Take a good look at the photo.

134
00:08:57,200 --> 00:09:00,200
Who is reflected in the kettle?

135
00:09:03,550 --> 00:09:04,960
If, as you claim,

136
00:09:05,510 --> 00:09:07,120
you and Chen Yun were willing partners,

137
00:09:07,600 --> 00:09:10,870
why is Wu Jia in a photo you took?

138
00:09:11,630 --> 00:09:13,150
I'll show the photo to Chen Yun

139
00:09:13,240 --> 00:09:15,030
and ask if she remembers you taking it.

140
00:09:19,120 --> 00:09:19,960
Admit it.

141
00:09:21,600 --> 00:09:26,200
If Wu Jia hadn't kept coercing
and blackmailing me,

142
00:09:26,200 --> 00:09:27,390
I never would've killed him.

143
00:09:28,960 --> 00:09:30,390
Chen Yun was too naive.

144
00:09:31,200 --> 00:09:33,030
She was just an outlet for me.

145
00:09:33,790 --> 00:09:36,600
She thought I'd fall in love with her.

146
00:09:40,840 --> 00:09:41,720
Did you?

147
00:09:43,550 --> 00:09:44,360
I...

148
00:09:48,240 --> 00:09:49,440
[Interrogation Room 3]
Will you still cover for Zhou Yong?

149
00:09:49,750 --> 00:09:50,630
[Interrogation Room 3]
Look at this.

150
00:09:58,630 --> 00:09:59,630
I'll talk.

151
00:10:03,000 --> 00:10:04,030
I'll tell you everything.

152
00:10:25,720 --> 00:10:28,030
Free liquor always tastes better.

153
00:10:30,200 --> 00:10:31,630
You asked me out in such a hurry,

154
00:10:31,630 --> 00:10:33,240
afraid I'd renege?

155
00:10:33,360 --> 00:10:34,910
Life is short.

156
00:10:35,150 --> 00:10:37,440
Do what you want right away.

157
00:10:37,720 --> 00:10:38,840
Who needs so many reasons?

158
00:10:41,390 --> 00:10:42,840
Easy to say.

159
00:10:43,000 --> 00:10:44,390
Doing it is a different story.

160
00:10:44,630 --> 00:10:46,320
Even if you know what to do,

161
00:10:46,600 --> 00:10:48,510
you don't know where to start.

162
00:10:48,630 --> 00:10:50,720
What?
I rarely hear you complain.

163
00:10:51,440 --> 00:10:52,550
Are you in trouble?

164
00:10:55,360 --> 00:10:56,630
It's about

165
00:10:58,440 --> 00:11:00,200
my sister's disappearance.

166
00:11:02,440 --> 00:11:04,790
There's... there's a lead.

167
00:11:06,630 --> 00:11:07,750
Sometimes I wonder

168
00:11:08,550 --> 00:11:09,910
if I should keep going.

169
00:11:11,150 --> 00:11:12,510
What if I do find her,

170
00:11:13,000 --> 00:11:15,000
and the outcome is terrible?

171
00:11:16,030 --> 00:11:17,150
Could I accept it?

172
00:11:17,790 --> 00:11:18,790
Sometimes, I even think

173
00:11:20,750 --> 00:11:21,960
that if I gave up,

174
00:11:23,550 --> 00:11:26,440
I could avoid all of this.

175
00:11:29,200 --> 00:11:30,960
I don't have your gift.

176
00:11:31,150 --> 00:11:33,030
I can't fully share another's feelings.

177
00:11:34,200 --> 00:11:35,630
But as your friend,

178
00:11:36,000 --> 00:11:37,630
I truly hope you can let it go.

179
00:11:38,840 --> 00:11:41,320
You can't spend your life
consumed by it.

180
00:11:47,840 --> 00:11:48,630
Oh, right.

181
00:11:49,000 --> 00:11:50,320
My insomnia has gotten worse again.

182
00:11:59,600 --> 00:12:00,390
Well...

183
00:12:02,000 --> 00:12:04,360
This only treats the symptoms,
not the cause.

184
00:12:04,840 --> 00:12:07,240
If anything unusual happens
while using it,

185
00:12:07,390 --> 00:12:08,200
be sure to...

186
00:12:10,440 --> 00:12:11,200
Uncle He.

187
00:12:11,240 --> 00:12:11,670
What is it?

188
00:12:12,550 --> 00:12:13,600
There's progress on the case.

189
00:12:13,720 --> 00:12:14,960
Come to Cuiping Mountain's back slope.

190
00:12:15,630 --> 00:12:16,200
Okay.

191
00:12:16,750 --> 00:12:17,440
I'll be right there.

192
00:12:19,550 --> 00:12:20,360
Sorry.

193
00:12:21,000 --> 00:12:22,240
Go take care of it.

194
00:12:22,320 --> 00:12:23,550
I enjoy wine more on my own anyway.

195
00:12:24,510 --> 00:12:26,120
I'll have a drink with you next time.

196
00:12:28,510 --> 00:12:28,870
I'm off.

197
00:12:29,000 --> 00:12:29,270
Mm-hmm.

198
00:13:22,430 --> 00:13:24,490
♪I stand in a fire-tempered jungle♪

199
00:13:24,490 --> 00:13:26,440
♪Withered leaves fall
as my strength runs dry♪

200
00:13:26,440 --> 00:13:28,350
♪Dust swirls as I clench my fists♪

201
00:13:28,350 --> 00:13:30,150
♪I strategize, my faith my armor♪

202
00:13:30,150 --> 00:13:32,490
♪My defiance spills onto concrete♪

203
00:13:32,490 --> 00:13:34,920
♪Even thick fog can't hide
my clear gaze♪

204
00:13:38,060 --> 00:13:39,970
♪Let neon turn to thorns♪

205
00:13:39,970 --> 00:13:41,860
♪Flying low as the stars shift and turn♪

206
00:13:41,860 --> 00:13:43,810
♪Escape the maze,
transcend the challenge♪

207
00:13:43,810 --> 00:13:45,930
♪The meter starts, breaking the silence♪

208
00:13:45,970 --> 00:13:47,940
♪A beam cuts through
a crack in the wall♪

209
00:13:47,940 --> 00:13:50,100
♪This rhythm and noise
echo through the streets♪

210
00:13:53,700 --> 00:13:57,180
♪Don't be afraid. No one will answer♪

211
00:13:57,180 --> 00:14:00,550
♪Why is that child crying?♪

212
00:14:00,780 --> 00:14:03,250
♪The shrinking scar on my arm♪

213
00:14:03,250 --> 00:14:04,870
♪Means I've grown up♪

214
00:14:04,870 --> 00:14:08,020
♪You can trust me when I say that♪

215
00:14:08,020 --> 00:14:11,500
♪The wound still aches♪

216
00:14:11,910 --> 00:14:16,260
♪Like a biting winter♪

217
00:14:16,260 --> 00:14:19,530
♪But a spark still glows♪

